# Fill help: `bash s10b-gate-d3a9.sh --fill-help <S10-A landing sha>` (read-only; prints the values below) or README.md.
# ---- base = the S10-A landing commit: exactly ONE commit on a4af8e33 adding the 14 FREEZE paths. Unknown at authoring.
